                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "Alloy Steel AISI 9-4-30 Vac Melt is a low alloy, high strength steel with a high nickel and cobalt content to promote toughness. Designed to have high hardenability with good weldability and excellent fracture toughness, HP 9-4-30 Vac Melt is often used in aircraft structural components, rocket motor cases, armor plate, pressure vessels and gears."
